    "detailed_description": "Explore a twisted world while Swapping between either of these two birds, <br />\r\nusing the environment and differences of these two birds as your arsenal to <br />\r\novercome obstacles or to discover secrets only obtainable due to their differences.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nTake on brief minigames and view the world outside of your shelter.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThe game requires immense precision, adaptive skill, planning ahead and at times patience.<br />\r\nSometimes the game acts like a Puzzle, and if you are not properly prepared<br />\r\nyou may lose your ability to progress, in some specific areas only.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n<br />\r\nI hope you are comfortable enough, so that you may derive enjoyment from it!",
    "about_the_game": "Explore a twisted world while Swapping between either of these two birds, <br />\r\nusing the environment and differences of these two birds as your arsenal to <br />\r\novercome obstacles or to discover secrets only obtainable due to their differences.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nTake on brief minigames and view the world outside of your shelter.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThe game requires immense precision, adaptive skill, planning ahead and at times patience.<br />\r\nSometimes the game acts like a Puzzle, and if you are not properly prepared<br />\r\nyou may lose your ability to progress, in some specific areas only.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n<br />\r\nI hope you are comfortable enough, so that you may derive enjoyment from it!",
